                    "image": "https://picsum.photos/seed/blog-heart/600/400",
                    "titleEn": "Beyond the Keyboard: Why Blogging is Still the Beating Heart of the Social Web",
                    "titleFr": "Au-delà du clavier : Pourquoi le blogue reste le cœur battant du Web social",
                    "dateEn": "Published on May 31, 2026",
